data emit_on_demand_family_cadence_note: String = "The seven emit-on-demand family aggregates (9 witness families: add, field_access, complement, match, loop, fold_closure, meet_join, variant_construct, classical_not_ingested) enroll on this nightly Wet cadence 2026-07-21: each emits real Rust, cargo-builds under the admitted build_workspace_grant envelope, runs the native binary, and compares against the interpreted oracle. Enrolled after the 2026-07-20 regression proved the class was invisible to CI (test/claim/execution/ excluded from hermetic discovery AND offline roster - the enrolled-but-never-run coverage-by-illusion class): the sorted_fields interner-order bug broke all 9 families' wet legs and nothing red-ed. This cadence is the rot-detector. Per-PR stays hermetic; the full CI-on-v2 cutover (P6) additionally needs the is_hermetic blanket refusal in emit_host_run_transport replaced by the Admitted verdict (effect-grants seam) plus the content-keyed result store so builds amortize."

data falsifier_self_host_wet_module_bindings_revocation_note: String = "2026-07-25: the six SelfEmitted wet bindings were RED on cadence run 30126573464 (cargo/shim closure refuse on seed-linked assemble — unresolved std_algebra/std_types/std_nat/List and target_carriers type-shape). Green wet roster stays empty (enrollment note: green-only). Phase-0 admission invariant forbids SelfEmitted-with-zero-executing-consumer: the six receipts move to falsifier_self_host_wet_known_red_entries (Wet expect_red quarantine) — still-red is agreement; greening is a counted un-quarantine that restores the green wet binding. Frontier rows stay SelfEmitted."

data falsifier_self_host_wet_module_bindings: List<SelfHostWetReceiptBinding> = []

data falsifier_self_host_wet_known_red_note: String = "Wet expect_red quarantine for SelfEmitted module behavioral receipts that red on assemble (Phase-0 admission invariant, review #7199 2026-07-25): same mechanism as known_red_probe_entries but Wet-profiled — hermetic would refuse the host effect and lie about the red class. claim_executor expect_red-inverts the batch. Owner: #7199 falsifier lane / self-host assemble. Dissolve-on per row: local wet receipt greens under gunbc_falsifier_self_host_wet_receipt_wall_budget, the known-red entry deletes, and the SelfHostWetReceiptBinding restores to the green wet roster."

